    {
      "id": "sensor-information",
      "label": "Sensor Information",
      "description": "Enter one or more sensors.  \nDefinitions:\n\n- **Instrument** is the large physical instrument that may house individual or smaller components, aka sensors.\n - **Components** are the individual sensors within an instrument. There may be multiple components within a single instrument. Example two radar gauges within one instrument.",
